              "blocks": [
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.1 After the company merger, several employees",
                      "correctAnswer": ["got canned"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	"and had to find new jobs."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.2 Everyone knows that Mark is the boss’s",
                      "correctAnswer": ["right-hand man"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "— he helps with every decision."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.3 I trusted Lisa completely, but she",
                      "correctAnswer": ["stabbed me in the back"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "and revealed my secret."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.4",
                      "correctAnswer": ["Chin up"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ", things will get better soon — don’t lose hope!"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.5 Don’t worry, the manager may still",
                      "correctAnswer": ["change his mind"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "and give you another chance."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.6 You think I’ll lend him money again?",
                      "correctAnswer": ["When pigs fly"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "!"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.7 She got angry and",
                      "correctAnswer": ["told him off"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "her boss after he blamed her unfairly."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.8 Don’t be so negative — try to",
                      "correctAnswer": ["look on the bright side"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "and see something good in this situation."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.9 I never want to",
                      "correctAnswer": ["set eyes on"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "that liar again!"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.10",
                      "correctAnswer": ["Thank goodness"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "the storm is finally over!"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.11 Things are tough now, but",
                      "correctAnswer": ["hang in there"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "— better days are coming."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.12 He’s been",
                      "correctAnswer": ["out of work"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "for months, but he keeps trying to find a job."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.13 During the recession, many families had to",
                      "correctAnswer": ["live from hand to mouth"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "just to survive."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.14 She’s been really",
                      "correctAnswer": ["stressed out"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "lately because of her heavy workload."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.15 We don’t earn much, but we still manage to",
                      "correctAnswer": ["make ends meet"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "each month."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.16 As a",
                      "correctAnswer": ["last resort"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ", we can borrow money from my parents if things get worse."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.17",
                      "correctAnswer": ["If worse comes to worst"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ", we can move into my aunt’s house until we find a new place."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.18 Don’t be afraid to",
                      "correctAnswer": ["think big"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "— you might succeed if you take the risk!"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.19 Starting a business sounds easy, but it’s definitely",
                      "correctAnswer": ["easier said than done"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
